Preprocessing and Training
•	Standardised continuous features using z-score scaling [file:132]
•	Split the data into 80% training and 20% testing using stratified sampling [file:132]
•	Applied GridSearchCV with 5-fold cross-validation for SVM and GBM hyperparameter tuning [file:132]
•	Evaluated results with classification metrics and confusion matrices [file:132]
